# SEO

Canonical: `.agents/rules/seo.md` · deep guide: `.agents/skills/seo/SKILL.md`

## Hard rules

- Every route exports `metadata` or `generateMetadata` (unique title + description).
- Spanish Peru (`es_PE`); copy in Spanish.
- Defaults from `config/metadata.ts` / `config/site.ts` — do not hardcode the site URL elsewhere.
- Public pages: indexable. Forms / private portals: `robots.index: false`.
- New indexable routes → add to `app/sitemap.ts`. Never sitemap `noindex` form URLs.
- Crawl config: `app/robots.ts`. Default OG: `app/opengraph-image.tsx`.
- Metadata lives in thin `app/**/page.tsx`, not buried inside feature section components.
